# Default for production builds (vite build): the current interface. Vite gives real environment variables priority
# over this file, so VITE_UI=chantier set in Vercel (Preview) or on the command line still selects the new interface.
# Defining the variable (even empty) lets the build drop the ui2 import entirely: no ui2 code and no ui2 media in
# the default build. Left unset, Vite cannot fold the switch and still loads (and emits the media of) ui2.
VITE_UI=
